      "change": "Added the librarian’s aging and the book’s timelessness as key clues.",
      "why": "Builds a stronger emotional arc and connects the mystery to the characters."
    },
    {
      "where": "discovery",
      "change": "Introduced the note inside the book as a pivotal clue.",
      "why": "Provides a concrete answer to the mystery and deepens the story’s emotional core."
    },
    {
      "where": "emotional_turn",
      "change": "Shifted focus from the librarian’s realization to the emotional impact of the discovery.",
      "why": "Enhances the emotional resonance and makes the story more relatable."
    },
    {
      "where": "payoff",
      "change": "Added the librarian joining the woman outside, showing a transformation.",
      "why": "Provides a satisfying resolution to the central question and completes the character arc."
    },
    {
